# The Jr flying saucer: hold the button, let go, the fan flies.
kits sc100
grid 7x5 grid-big
lift fwd
step 1: grid
step 2: B1 at 1A dir=right level=1
step 3: S2 at 1C dir=down level=1
step 4: M1 at 3E dir=up level=1
step 5: wire3 at 1A dir=down level=2
step 6: wire3 at 1E dir=right level=2
step 7: wire3 at 3C dir=up level=2
step 8: fan1 at 3E
scene spin: S2=pressed
scene fly: S2=released, launch=4
expect S2=pressed: M1 on fwd fly
expect S2=pressed, flip=4: M1 on rev blow
